Z||000013||Racer 1||07-09-99||03:22 PM||||Bn Boomer make sure you ask about a core charge.THE engine is 600$ with a  core charge.And if you were to buy the engine without core you would be paying around 1000-1200$$$$$$
Z||000014||theogre||07-09-99||09:36 PM||||check dealer quotes carefully. and check multiple dealers. Most of the time I've dealt with dealer motors, they don't even offer rebuilts. With an old block like the 2.5 you have got to be very presise in fooling with GM family dealers.
